    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oloontoluo le nkop e Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitokini aaisho erubata olosho le Manase, amu ninye apa olkikau le Yosef. O Makir olkikau le Manase, menye le Gilead, neorikini ninche Gilead o Bashan, amu oltung'ani apa lo larrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitokini aaoriki irubat lelo kulikae lo losho le Manase, too lmareita lenye, Abiesa, o Helek, o Asriel, o Shekem, o Hafer o Shenuda; kulo apa ilayiok ootoiuo Manase olayioni le Yosef, too lmareita lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa Selofehad olayioni le Hefer, olayioni le Gilead, olayioni le Makir, olayioni le Manase, nemeeta apa ilayiok, kake ntoyie apake eeta; naa kuna nkarn e nena toyie enyena: o Mahala, o Noa, o Hogla, o Milka, o Tinsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.1+NUM.27.2+NUM.27.3+NUM.27.4+NUM.27.5+NUM.27.6+NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 27.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nepuonu ninche dukuya Eliesa olapolosani o Yoshua olayioni le Nuni o larikok, nejo, “Eitanapa apa Olaitoriani Musa pee eisho iyiook enjung'ore te nebo ilalashera lang.” Neaku ore te risioroto e nkitanapata o Laitoriani eishoo ninye ninche enjung'ore te nebo ilalashera le papaai lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina apa pee enoto Manase irubat tomon, metii enkop e Gilead o Bashan, apa naatii lido likae kekun le Yordan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enkaraki natang'amutua intoyie e Manase enjung'ore te nebo ilayiok lenyena. Ore enkop e Gilead neorikini lelo kulikae le ishoi e Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkop e Manase nelo abaiki Asheri o metabaiki Mikmetat apa naa enkalo o loo saen le Shekem; nelo olpolosie enkalo e moikuape o metabaiki lelo oomanya Entapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enkop e Tapua naa ene Manase, kake ore enkang e Tapua apa natii olpolosie le Manase naa enoo layiok le Efraim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo ilo polosie adoyio o metabaiki enong'oto e Kana. Ore nkanas tene, te nkalo e moikuape e nong'oto ti atua nkanas e Manase, naa ine Efraim. Nelo apa olpolosie le Manase enkalo e kopikop e ina nong'oto nelo aiting te naiposha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore enkop te nkalo e moikuape naa ene Efraim, ore te nkalo e kopikop naa ene Manase, nelo enaiposha aitayu olpolosie; ore te nkalo e kopikop nebaiki Isaakar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii ti atua Isaakar o ti atua Asheri neeta apa Manase Betshean o nkang'itie enyena, o Ibleam o nkang'itie enyena, o lelo oomanya Dori o nkang'itie enyena, o lelo oomanya Endor o nkang'itie enyena, o lelo oomanya Taanak o nkang'itie enyena, o lelo oomanya Megido o nkang'itie enyena, ore ene uni naa Nafat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.27+JDG.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilari 1.27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore eyia eitu apa eidimu ilayiok le Manase aaibung'a nena anas; kake eting'iriakinote Ilkanaani aabik te ina kop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore apa pee eponari iltung'ana le Israel aagolu, nepik ninche Ilkanaani enkisiaayiare nagol, neitu earaa ninche tukul aaipang'ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eyieu Efraim o enkalo o loo ntoluo e Manase neponikini enkop",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirorie olosho le Yosef Yoshua, ejo, “Kainyoo iyie pee kinchoo nanu erubata nabo o eoroti nabo metaa enjung'ore, hoo nara olosho loo ltung'ana kumok, naatamayiana nanu Olaitoriani aiko nji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yoshua ninche, “Te nirara intae olosho loo ltung'ana kumok, elepa enchom entim, ore te ine, nisiajakinyenye ate enkop te ina kop oo Lperisi o ene Rafaim, amu ore ena kop oo ldoinyo e Efraim naa eironkai te intae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olosho le Yosef, “Meidip iyiook ena kop oo ldoinyo; ore ake sii kulo Kanaani pooki oomanya enkop naisiaja naa keeta ngarrin oo mbartan oo sekenke, lekua ootii Betshean o nkang'itie enyena o lekua ootii oerata le Yesreel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua ajoki enkaji e Yosef o Efraim o Manase, “Irara intae olosho loo ltung'ana kumok, niatata enkidimata kitok; mintokiki intae aata erubata nabo ake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake keaku eninyi ena kop oo ldoinyo, ore hoo naa entim, isiajayieyie intae niyaya ninye aaitabaiki ilpolosien lenyena oolakua; amu iyookiki intae aaraa aaipang'ie lelo Kanaani, hoo neeta ninche ngarrin oo mbartan oo sekenke, hoo naa kegol.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
